msgid "Documentation tools and preparation"
msgstr "文档工具与环境准备"

msgid ""
"Use this reference to prepare one maintained documentation environment. The "
"qualified build tuple is Linux x86_64 with CPython 3.12. The local "
"preparation uses CPython 3.12.14; CI selects the same patch version. "
"Documentation tool qualification does not grant firmware, hardware or "
"product qualification."
msgstr ""
"使用本参考准备维护中的文档环境。已验证构建组合是 Linux x86_64 与 CPython 3.12。本地准备使用 CPython "
"3.12.14；CI 选择同一补丁版本。文档工具资格不授予固件、硬件或产品资格。"

msgid ""
"First prepare the [fixed source and recursive "
"dependencies](../guides/source-checkout.md). The manifest and tool lock must"
" come from the same selected source revision."
msgstr "先准备[固定源码与递归依赖](../guides/source-checkout.md)。清单与工具锁必须来自同一选定源码版本。"

msgid "The authoritative closure"
msgstr "权威依赖闭包"

msgid ""
"`dependencies/docs-tools.lock.json` owns archive identities, target "
"constraints, direct requirements and license provenance. The complete Python"
" dependency set is also expressed in `dependencies/docs-python-linux-"
"cp312.txt`, using exact versions and SHA-256 hashes. "
"`docs/sphinx/requirements.txt` references that file; it does not define "
"another resolver input."
msgstr ""
"`dependencies/docs-tools.lock.json` 维护归档身份、目标约束、直接依赖和许可来源。完整 Python 依赖也在 "
"`dependencies/docs-python-linux-cp312.txt` 中列出，使用精确版本与 "
"SHA-256。`docs/sphinx/requirements.txt` 引用该文件，不定义另一份解析输入。"

